title: mf context new
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Event log]]
kind: reference
summary: Create a log context inside the current one and print it, to export as METAFOLDER_LOG_CONTEXT

Creates a log context named `NAME` (described by `DESCRIPTION`), inside the context
`METAFOLDER_LOG_CONTEXT` passes on when there is one, and prints it as
`<repo uuid>:<id>` — what to export so every `mf` started meanwhile creates its own
context inside it ([[Log contexts]]).
